namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamAdjustmentLayer {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamAdjustmentLayer.h#DreamAdjustmentLayer
    src   "An adjustment layer: its operations, in order, on what is behind it -- the colours under its rect, as far as its clips\nand their masks let it -- or on its own children. Brightness and contrast, levels, curves, exposure, hue and saturation,\nvibrance, colour balance, black and white, a photo filter, a channel mixer, invert, posterize, threshold, a gradient map\nand a lookup table; up to eight of them, mixed with what they were made from by a blend mode and an opacity.\n\nDrawn by DreamGUI's own renderer: screen-space, render-target and world-space (DreamUI renderer) canvases. On a canvas\nthe engine's renderer draws, nothing. The post process's Tint and output render target are not used."
    text  "调整图层：按顺序对其后方的内容执行各项操作——其矩形范围内的颜色，以剪辑\n及其遮罩允许的范围为限——或对其自身的子项执行操作。亮度与对比度、色阶、曲线、曝光、色相与饱和度、\n自然饱和度、色彩平衡、黑白、照片滤镜、通道混合器、反相、色调分离、阈值、渐变映射\n和查找表；最多八项，通过混合模式和不透明度与生成它们的源内容混合。\n\n由DreamGUI自身的渲染器绘制：屏幕空间、渲染目标和世界空间（DreamUI渲染器）画布。在由引擎\n渲染器绘制的画布上，不产生任何效果。不使用后期处理的着色和输出渲染目标。"
    state machine
}

DreamAdjustmentLayer:Adjustments {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamAdjustmentLayer.h#DreamAdjustmentLayer:Adjustments
    src   "The operations, in order: each works on what the one before made. The first eight enabled ones are drawn."
    text  "按顺序排列的操作：每项都基于前一项的结果进行处理。绘制前八项已启用的操作。"
    state machine
}

DreamAdjustmentLayer:EffectBlendMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamAdjustmentLayer.h#DreamAdjustmentLayer:EffectBlendMode
    src   "How what the operations made is blended with what they were made from: every mode, by the same formulas as an element's."
    text  "各项操作生成的结果与生成它们的源内容如何混合：支持所有模式，公式与元素相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamAdjustmentLayer:Opacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamAdjustmentLayer.h#DreamAdjustmentLayer:Opacity
    src   "How much of what the operations made replaces what they were made from; times the visual's own alpha."
    text  "各项操作生成的结果替换生成它们的源内容的程度；会乘以视觉自身的Alpha。"
    state machine
}

